              "segment": {
                "start_index": 377,
                "end_index": 628,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "A direct comparison of Sputnik 1 with one of the most advanced commercial satellites\u2014the **AST SpaceMobile BlueBird Block 2** (the heaviest and largest commercial communication satellite in Low Earth Orbit (LEO))\u2014highlights this profound evolution"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 665,
                "end_index": 841,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "| Feature | The First: **Sputnik 1** (1957) | The Latest: **BlueBird Block 2** (2025/2026) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Launch Date** | October 4, 1957 | Late 2025 / Early 2026"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                3,
                5
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 922,
                "end_index": 940,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "6.5 metric tonnes)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4,
                6
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1108,
                "end_index": 1171,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "220 square meters)\u2014larger than a standard 3-bedroom apartment"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1523,
                "end_index": 1605,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "| **10 GHz of processing bandwidth**, delivering peak speeds of up to **120 Mbps**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1692,
                "end_index": 1752,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "| **Standard, unmodified 4G/5G smartphones** in remote areas"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2029,
                "end_index": 2085,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "| Mass-produced in specialized, high-tech assembly lines"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                3,
                8
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2386,
                "end_index": 2480,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "By contrast, modern satellites like the BlueBird Block 2 or SpaceX\u2019s Starlink V3 are massive"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2482,
                "end_index": 2550,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Once in space, BlueBird unfolds a colossal flat phased-array antenna"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2552,
                "end_index": 2733,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Because it must beam cellular signals directly to tiny antennas inside everyday smartphones from hundreds of miles away, the satellite itself must act as a giant cell tower in space"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                9
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3121,
                "end_index": 3201,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Solar arrays on satellites like Starlink V2 Mini span up to 30 meters (100 feet)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                0,
                8
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3702,
                "end_index": 3923,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "They process terabits of data, communicate with other satellites in space using **infrared lasers** (laser cross-links), and beam high-speed internet to remote villages, airplanes, ships, and standard handheld smartphones"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                9
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 4113,
                "end_index": 4295,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Modern satellites carry sophisticated **attitude control systems** (using star trackers and reaction wheels) and **ion propulsion engines** (often fueled by Argon, Krypton, or Xenon)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                10
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 4781,
                "end_index": 4833,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "There are **over 10,000 active satellites** in orbit"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 4835,
                "end_index": 4965,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Instead of launching one custom-made satellite every few years, commercial space companies now mass-produce them on assembly lines"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                11
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 4967,
                "end_index": 5160,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "SpaceX alone launches thousands of satellites annually\u2014meaning more satellites are now launched in a single month than were launched during the first several decades of the Space Age combined"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            }
